menu "Application Configuration"

config MODBUS_BAUD_RATE
    int "Modbus RTU baud rate"
    default 115200
    help
        Baud rate of the RS-485 link to the heat pump. Must match the
        Modbus baud rate configured on the Kronoterm controller.

config MODBUS_SLAVE_ADDRESS
    int "Modbus slave address"
    range 1 247
    default 20
    help
        Modbus address of the Kronoterm heat pump controller.

endmenu
